  speakerName: Roboman
  dialogue:
  - dialogueLine: Congraulations, Mr. Knight! You've made it to your final round!
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 0
      endDialogue: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
      complexEffects: []
      reputation: 0
      loyalviewers: 0
      sponsers: 0
      money: 0
      corruption: 0
      givenItem: {fileID: 0}
  - dialogueLine: Of course it hasn't been easy, I've seen you throughout the way.
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 0
      endDialogue: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
      complexEffects: []
      reputation: 0
      loyalviewers: 0
      sponsers: 0
      money: 0
      corruption: 0
      givenItem: {fileID: 0}
  - dialogueLine: But this next round will be unlike anything you've ever faced before.
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 0
      endDialogue: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
      complexEffects: []
      reputation: 0
      loyalviewers: 0
      sponsers: 0
      money: 0
      corruption: 0
      givenItem: {fileID: 0}
  - dialogueLine: Instead of the numerous of weak enemies you've faced before...
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 0
      endDialogue: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
      complexEffects: []
      reputation: 0
      loyalviewers: 0
      sponsers: 0
      money: 0
      corruption: 0
      givenItem: {fileID: 0}
  - dialogueLine: There will be one BIG enemy instead. A "boss" if you will.
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 0
      endDialogue: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
      complexEffects: []
      reputation: 0
      loyalviewers: 0
      sponsers: 0
      money: 0
      corruption: 0
      givenItem: {fileID: 0}
  - dialogueLine: I'd recommend you prepare for this battle. After all, you can go
      home after this!
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 0
      endDialogue: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
      complexEffects: []
      reputation: 0
      loyalviewers: 0
      sponsers: 0
      money: 0
      corruption: 0
      givenItem: {fileID: 0}
  - dialogueLine: The reason we have a boss is because taking people back to the
      past is a dificult process, and the butterfly effect makes things reeeaaallly
      complicted. So, only the best of warriors can survive.
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 0
      endDialogue: 0
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 0}
      complexEffects: []
      reputation: 0
      loyalviewers: 0
      sponsers: 0
      money: 0
      corruption: 0
      givenItem: {fileID: 0}
  - dialogueLine: Everything you've done has led up to this very moment. Goodluck,
      Mr. Knight. I'll see you one last time if you make it out alive.
    choices: []
    effects:
      hasEffects: 1
      endDialogue: 1
      nextDialogue: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 3e998699a307a374e8e4687415a7bb81, type: 2}
      complexEffects: []
      reputation: 0
